  "description": "OGUNOV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: 2(C45 H69 Co3 N3 O13 1+),C28 H58 Gd4 N6 O34 P2 2-,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Co10 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.196-4.206 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.01-120.20°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C122H202Co6Gd4N14O60P2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
